

# Gold ICT Pro

# Phase 10 Foundation Specification

## Architecture Freeze v1.0

### Status: 🔒 FROZEN

**Purpose**

This document defines the permanent architectural foundation of the Gold ICT Pro Engine. Every implementation must conform to this specification. Any future enhancement must extend the architecture without violating these contracts unless a critical design flaw is discovered.

---

# 1. Core Philosophy

The engine is designed around the following principles:

* Deterministic execution
* Replay-safe computation
* Non-repainting logic
* Immutable registries
* Single writer ownership
* Fail-closed integrity
* Event-driven communication
* Broker independence
* Platform independence
* Test-first validation

---

