# 5. Engine Lifecycle

```text
BOOT

↓

INITIALIZE

↓

READY

↓

RUNNING

↓

DEGRADED

↓

PAUSED

↓

RECOVERY

↓

SHUTDOWN
```

Definitions:

BOOT

Program starting.

INITIALIZE

Create services.

READY

Waiting for market.

RUNNING

Normal execution.

DEGRADED

Integrity violation.

No execution.

Still auditing.

PAUSED

Intentional pause.

RECOVERY

Restarting after interruption.

SHUTDOWN

Clean exit.

